WEBVTT

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.520
Look, the sky up above has begun to move.
Hora miageta sora ugokidashita yo

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.750
Your astonishment was so dazzling.
Odoroku kimi mabushikute

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.810
Should I forgive the lies you told me yesterday
Kinou tsuita uso mo yurusou kana

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.050
just because the morning light is so pretty?
Kesa no hikari kirei dakara

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:38.170
The sound of your laughter is always important to me
Kimi no warai goe itsu datte daiji da yo

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.820
because it gives me courage.
Yuuki kureru kara saa

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.680
It's not a lie.
Uso ja nai

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.460
It's a beauty really
It's a beauty really

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.610
Your voice whenever.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.990
It makes me have.

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:51.660
Even the silliest things sound dear,
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:57.980
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo
Even the silliest things sound dear,

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.540
if it's your voice I hear.
kimi no koe nara

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.810
You're sad whenever.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.120
It takes you back.
You're sad whenever.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:05.460
It takes you back.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:08.840
My heart runneth over.
Hamidasu kokoro

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:16.040
Unable to control myself, I set off at a run.
Osaerarenakute hashiri dashita yo

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:19.050
I can forever.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.140
Please let me get into Oumi Academy.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.640
Please let me have a love I can look forward to.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.840
Please let me be a man good enough for all of them.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.860
Junpei, did you pray that I'd pass the exams?

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:02.320
On a side note, please let Yui get into Oumi Academy.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:03.850
"On a side note"?

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:06.740
What do you mean by "side note"?!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:11.080
Ow... You didn't have to punch me.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:13.760
Manaka-kun! Yui-chan!

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.320
Toujou!

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.960
W-What's up?

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.340
It's New Year's, so give her an appropriate greeting!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.320
A Happy New Year to you.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.100
Happy New Year. Please take
care of me this year as well.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:37.300
Once Again the Dream Continues

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.160
Yui-chan, which high schools are you testing for?

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.800
Oh, didn't I tell you?

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.860
Oumi Academy!

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.930
I'm not testing anywhere else.
Oumi Academy's my one and only choice.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.690
[Protective Charm]

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:51.900
But, it's a really high-level school.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.990
I was only investigating the dorm situation,

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:57.230
but my recent trip there was surprising.

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:00.170
I think I can just barely make it.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.440
Oumi Academy...?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.850
Do you want to use
the materials I used

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.550
for last year's Oumi Academy entrance exam?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.250
Don't you go to Izumizaka along with Junpei, Toujou-san?

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.980
Originally, Oumi Academy was my first choice.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.120
But I ended up not taking the test.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.930
Oh?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:26.460
B-But Toujou definitely would've passed if she'd taken it.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.230
Everyone's still mystified that Toujou chose Izumizaka.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:31.740
Manaka-kun...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.230
S-Sorry, I got carried away.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.460
Do you have any major plans for winter vacation?

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:44.960
Anything important to do?
Aside from homework, not that much.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.450
In that case, could you be my tutor? Please?

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.200
S-Seriously?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.100
I'm serious. Since Junpei speaks so highly of you,

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.170
you must be really smart.

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.420
At my house?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.690
Where <i>else</i> would we go?

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.990
Umm, if you'd like to start tomorrow...

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:04.430
That'd be great!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.930
I really appreciate it!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.410
Well, I can't say I <i>mind</i> Toujou coming over to my house.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.610
Good afternoon!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:19.950
Welco--

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.100
Toujou-san, come on up!
Welco--

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.420
Toujou-san, come on up!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.380
Excuse me.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.760
Junpei, don't peek or anything.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.460
What about Manaka-kun's parents?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.320
Oh, they both went shopping.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:42.230
I'm glad someone as dumb as Junpei has a friend as smart as you.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:44.930
This is what I'd call "slander."

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.780
But, this sure brings back memories.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:54.500
There was also a time when Toujou tutored me.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.400
I hope I can teach you well.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.510
Oh, I'm sure you can!

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.830
I've really been
looking forward to today.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.370
Really, Yui-chan? I'll try my best.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.330
Yes, I'll try my best too!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:10.950
Please take care of me.
Okay.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.030
Please take care of me.

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:12.700
Sure thing.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.990
Ah, Yui-chan...

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:18.540
You can use the equation I just taught you for that.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.920
I missed it again.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.770
And I did this problem so many times... I'm sorry.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.940
It must suck to keep on
explaining the same things.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.650
No, that's not true.

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.740
Problems like these...

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:34.990
...always seem difficult at first glance.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:38.320
But after solving the same problems many times,

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.480
you eventually see a pattern.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.110
I looked into it yesterday,

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.550
and this type of question
showed up a lot last year.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.340
How cool...

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:54.400
You're so pretty and smart.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:57.040
I wish I could have been born like you.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:59.500
N-No, don't think that way...

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.060
Hey, why didn't you go to Oumi Academy? Tell me.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.610
U-Uhh... it's because...

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:09.130
Then it must be because of...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.330
Umm...

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.820
Choosing a school based on
someone you like going there...?

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:19.970
Yes, that's probably... right.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.720
Oh? So that's how it is.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:28.030
I think I'd still go to the school I wanted to attend.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:32.180
But I wouldn't understand; I've never had a boyfriend.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:33.230
You know...

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.480
It's something of an
unrequited love for me.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.460
No way?! An unrequited love?!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.810
Have you confessed to him?

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.830
I'm sure it's requited,
so give it a shot!

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.840
I guarantee it.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:48.350
Y-Yui-chan, you're
talking kind of loudly...

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:54.320
And what's more, he's had a
girlfriend since middle school.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.890
That's why I...

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.280
A girlfriend...?

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:03.120
But you know, love doesn't last forever.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.320
I don't have anyone I like, so I wouldn't know.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:09.460
Maybe he's already broken up
with his girlfriend.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:15.340
It seems like Junpei broke
up with his girlfriend too.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.710
Ahh, I'm sorry!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.960
There're towels in the kitchen.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:24.210
Okay!
There're towels in the kitchen.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:24.600
Okay!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.230
Are you okay, Toujou-san?!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.110
I-I'm fine. Sorry, Yui-chan.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:47.960
Stubbing your little toe really hurts...

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.080
Yeah.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.150
That's it!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.490
Why don't we take a break while this dries?

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.490
Y-Yeah, good idea.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.460
I'll go buy some snacks.

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.350
I'm off!

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:29.960
Toujou...

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:38.160
She must've stayed up late
getting ready for the tutoring.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:42.820
Toujou's handwritten notes?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.870
I still have mine
stored away in my desk.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:54.170
I kind of want to watch
her sleeping face forever.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.970
This notebook's from our 3rd year of middle school...

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:07.390
Toujou was using this
notebook for her novel.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.350
Ah, erm...

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.670
D-Did I wake you?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.090
Erm, this notebook...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.010
The notebook?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.480
It brings back memories.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.350
Manaka-kun, would you like to read it again?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:47.040
I've written more for you to read.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:48.910
For me?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:54.320
Yes, you're that novel's only reader.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:57.210
Really? That's sort of a waste.

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:59.880
Not that I'm complaining.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.930
I like this scene.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:09.630
Eh? Which one?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.850
This scene where they climb the stairs and are reunited.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.320
The joy of their reunion
slowly builds up

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.700
as they look at the town below. Doesn't it feel nice?

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.170
This scene after that was good, too.

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.360
And this parent-child confrontation scene is exactly like...

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:28.080
And then the father, holding in his sadness, sets off for the battlefield.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.740
I cried a little bit.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.080
Eh? Really?!

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:36.150
This is the feeling.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.840
When I met Toujou, I was finally able to talk about my dreams...

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.330
Also, I cried here too--

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:53.110
Erm, t-this scene was good, too.

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:55.020
Manaka-kun.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:56.500
Yes?

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:58.690
Umm...

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:05.510
Umm... is it okay if I ask you something s-strange?

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.240
Something strange?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.660
She can't be... confessing her love?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:12.690
Umm... don't take this the wrong way...

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.360
I just heard from Yui, but...

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.160
Y-Yui!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.570
Am I interrupting anything?

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.890
I'll be right outside!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.390
It's not like that, you dummy!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.510
Why did you deliberately listen in?!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.400
Why didn't you just come in like a normal person?

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.960
Why are you acting like it was a date?

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:46.110
I was just listening for the heck of it.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:50.640
I thought you'd want to be alone with Toujou-san.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:51.890
Well, sort of.

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.520
I can help you out.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.040
Every time Toujou comes here to tutor me,

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.530
I'll "disappear" for ten minutes.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.560
How's that?

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.130
Being alone with Toujou is...

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.260
A step in the right direction...

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:08.170
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.930
D-Dummy!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.040
The only thing <i>you</i> need to be thinking about is studying!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.720
Eh? You're going home tomorrow, Yui-chan?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.230
Yeah, I've got school.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:36.260
But I'm really glad I was able to study with you.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:38.220
I feel really confident now.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:39.540
You're right.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:43.740
I can see you were able to master the parts you weren't good at.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.530
You should do fine on the test.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.450
Hey, Yui-chan, why don't we stop here for today?

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.100
How about we use our
remaining time to take a walk?

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:58.260
Really? Yay! Yay!

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:02.210
Junpei's always at work, so I never have anyone to hang out with.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:07.210
Hug Me in the Snow!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.510
Man, I'm so stupid.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.890
I traded shifts to work on
Christmas Eve and got today off.

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:18.020
I went to work when I didn't even have to.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.800
Yui and Toujou?

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:26.030
Junpei! Weren't you working today?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.530
As it turns out, no.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:31.910
Huh?

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.500
What? Why're we all meeting here?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.090
I had some free time, so I thought I'd go to the bookstore.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.630
What's wrong, Yui-chan?

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:47.430
Satsuki-chan is going to
torture to me again.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.890
<i>You're</i> the one who tortured <i>me!</i>

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.890
Scary!

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.940
Satsuki-chan, Aya-chan, why don't we do something, now that we're together?

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.900
W-Well, I don't really mind.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:03.820
Manaka, where should we go?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.150
Anywhere is fine.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.250
Yui-chan, what do you want to do?

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.660
Is it okay if I tag along?

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:15.920
Okay! Why not let Yui-chan decide?

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.190
Yes, let's.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:20.150
Yeah, is there anything you want to do?

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.920
Tell us what you want to do.

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.300
Umm... umm...

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.720
Let's play hide and seek!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.470
1... 2... 3...

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:35.920
How can we play hide and seek when it's this cold?!

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.460
It's pointless!

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:42.020
How about we hide close together and share our body heat?

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.820
Thanks, but no thanks!

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.780
I might be just a tiny bit excited.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:53.120
I haven't played hide and seek since elementary school.

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:57.330
I see, Yui hasn't done this since she moved.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.960
She was the one who always
wanted to play hide and seek.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:05.800
Now that I think about it, I never
could find her hiding places.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.130
You're going to hide
behind the toilet, too?

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.720
I-I guess so.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:18.550
I guess we were
thinking the same thing.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.700
Hey, can't you move over a bit--

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.030
Why don't <i>you</i> move over a bit?!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:26.350
Don't be so loud, you dummy! We'll be found.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.450
W-We should be fine like this.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:37.490
Yeah.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:42.120
Hmm? Yui's hair smells just like my shampoo.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.920
Why am I getting nervous over <i>that?</i>

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.630
Junpei...

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.930
Junpei, you've changed, haven't you?

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:57.340
Really? I don't really see how...

00:15:57.340 --> 00:16:02.080
You have changed. We used to be able to hide here easily.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.690
That, and your voice.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.150
Your voice has gotten a lot deeper.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:11.310
What's more, you've dated a girl before.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:15.530
It's kind of like you've matured.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.660
Hey, have I changed?

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.330
Why?

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:25.190
Why is she saying something like that in a place like this?

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.420
Toujou and Kitaouji, found you!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.800
This is bad!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:35.250
Together, we'll be too easy to find.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.550
I'll go hide somewhere else.

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:40.350
W-What do you mean,
"somewhere else"?

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.060
It's a secret. Don't let him find you, either!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.350
Good luck!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.110
I guess she really is a child...

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.990
But, what was that?

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.950
Just before, she...

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:57.160
Manaka, found you!

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.830
The only one left is Yui-chan.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.940
I couldn't find her at all.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.670
She has a special place.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.420
And where is that?

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.430
Well... I don't really know, myself.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.220
Hey, Yui-chan!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.760
Yui!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.810
Where are you hiding?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:30.190
This is pretty bad.
Hasn't it been about an hour?

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.460
In a way, she might be a genius.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.340
I have to respect her a bit.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:38.160
We have to hurry up and find her.
It's getting colder.

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:41.580
It's snowing.

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.250
No wonder it's cold.

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:48.250
Do you think she just
went home already?

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:53.840
No, she's never gone home without being found first.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:58.430
Why don't we pretend to go home and fake her out?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.260
Ah, I see.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.560
She might think something's strange and come out.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.620
Yeah.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:10.690
But Yui might be so cold that she can't move...

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:15.070
That girl's never
broken a rule in her life.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.240
So she must still be
somewhere in this park.

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.250
But where?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:24.580
She's such a child. This game is serious business to her.

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:27.080
Just come on out already.

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.450
If something happened to her...

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:37.590
No, right now I have to search for her.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:46.660
Yui!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:52.150
You never would've found me if I hadn't sneezed.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.640
Why you...

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:57.990
Yui-chan!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.910
So much for my secret hiding place--

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.800
Dummy!

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:09.000
Why did you hide out here while the snow piled up?!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:13.470
Lots of people in this world freeze to death, you know!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.840
We were all worried about you.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.370
Junpei...?

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:22.340
Junpei.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.350
Hey, are you crying?

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:32.600
You really are a crybaby, Junpei.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:40.170
Thanks for bringing
my luggage, Junpei.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.120
Yeah.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:46.450
But, Yui, can you really get on
the train from here by yourself?

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.330
I'll be okay.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:49.830
Yui-chan!

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:56.830
You all came to see me off?

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.300
Even Satsuki-chan!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:03.300
N-No, I was just worried you'd caught a cold playing hide and seek yesterday.

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:07.480
You need make sure your body's in good shape for your exams.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:11.100
Actually, you should just test for Izumizaka.

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:15.560
Yeah, Oumi Academy's exams are so hard they're impossible... for you.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.620
Is something wrong, Yui-chan?

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.150
I-I'm sorry. It's my fault.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.530
I said something mean.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:27.660
No, it's just that if I go home, I'll be lonely.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.910
It's kind of strange, isn't it?

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.250
Even though we'll see each other again in the spring...

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.210
Don't cry, you dummy.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.360
Before you call <i>me</i> a crybaby,

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:37.960
take a look at yourself.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.270
But!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.590
Won't you be back in this city to take your exams?

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.140
When that time comes,
we'll come and pick you up again.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.160
Really?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.640
Really! Let's play together again.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.550
So... let me get a picture of your crying face.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.190
Come back any time, okay?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:03.070
Is it okay if I sleep in your bed,
even after I get into high school?

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.570
Yeah, of course!

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:07.570
I'll plan on it!

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.710
See you later, everybody!

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:15.580
W-Wait, you!

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:18.430
What did you mean by your last statement?!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.350
Huh-huh, she said "bed"...

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:32.940
M-Manaka...

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:36.230
I-It's not like that.
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:38.960
Hey... Stop...

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.050
One... Two...

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:43.190
Attack!!

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:49.020
Go go!
Ike ike

